#: includes/class-admin.php:175
msgid "Add the \"Space2Book booking\" block to a page, or use the shortcode:"
msgstr ""
"Fügen Sie einer Seite den Block „Space2Book-Buchung“ hinzu oder verwenden "
"Sie den Shortcode:"

#: includes/class-admin.php:177
msgid ""
"Shortcode attributes: venue, mode (button, inline or link), language (nl, "
"en, de, fr, es or auto), text and height."
msgstr ""
"Shortcode-Attribute: venue, mode (button, inline oder link), language (nl, "
"en, de, fr, es oder auto), text und height."

#: includes/class-admin.php:191
msgid ""
"Connect this site to the public booking form of your Space2Book venue. No "
"API keys are needed."
msgstr ""
"Verbinden Sie diese Website mit dem öffentlichen Buchungsformular Ihres "
"Space2Book-Standorts. API-Schlüssel sind nicht erforderlich."

#. translators: %s: domain name of this website.
#: includes/class-admin.php:196
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Space2Book only allows embedded booking forms on registered domains. Make "
"sure %s is registered for your venue in Space2Book."
msgstr ""
"Space2Book erlaubt eingebettete Buchungsformulare nur auf registrierten "
"Domains. Stellen Sie sicher, dass %s für Ihren Standort in Space2Book "
"registriert ist."

#: includes/class-admin.php:217
msgid ""
"The public reference of your venue, as shown in your Space2Book account. "
"Letters, digits, hyphens and underscores only."
msgstr ""
"Die öffentliche Kennung Ihres Standorts, wie in Ihrem Space2Book-Konto "
"angezeigt. Nur Buchstaben, Ziffern, Bindestriche und Unterstriche."

